{"id": "65522", "title": "倾尽一世宠溺", "author": "颜莫兮", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 37, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/65/65522.htm", "intro": "那年冬天北京城的雪下得特别大，顾西莫在雪中遇见了小小的夏倾辰，他只是觉得心脏的某个地方似乎柔软了，于是他知道，自己逃不掉了......\r\n 世间烦乱，我只想倾尽我一世宠溺，任你肆意妄为\r\n ，幸福无忧\r\n 夏倾辰，你的岁月静好\r\n ，只能是我给的。\r\n 这是顾西莫对夏倾辰说过的最美的情话。\r\n 我本不在意什么，不执着什么，但顾西莫，你是我唯一想霸占着的。，", "base": "files/article/html/65/65522", "chapters": [{"title": "不过是倾城", "file": "9750490.html", "available": false}, {"title": "腹黑的顾西莫", "file": "9750492.html", "available": false}, {"title": "小时候", "file": "9750494.html", "available": false}, {"title": "只因她是夏倾辰", "file": "9750496.html", "available": false}, {"title": "护短", "file": "9750497.html", "available": false}, {"title": "过去", "file": "9750498.html", "available": false}, {"title": "吃醋的顾少爷", "file": "9750499.html", "available": false}, {"title": "被收拾了", "file": "9750504.html", "available": false}, {"title": "知足", "file": "9750506.html", "available": false}, {"title": "熟人儿", "file": "9750508.html", "available": false}, {"title": "毒嘴苏少爷", "file": "9750510.html", "available": false}, {"title": "要你，便只能是你", "file": "9750511.html", "available": false}, {"title": "这倒是有了点欢聚一堂的味道了", "file": "9750512.html", "available": false}, {"title": "危险", "file": "9750513.html", "available": false}, {"title": "陆易寰，你想做什么", "file": "9750514.html", "available": false}, {"title": "媳妇儿？老爷？", "file": "9750516.html", "available": false}, {"title": "冷酷", "file": "9750517.html", "available": false}, {"title": "碰不得的心尖尖儿", "file": "9750518.html", "available": false}, {"title": "非你不嫁", "file": "9750519.html", "available": false}, {"title": "付出他的爱", "file": "9750520.html", "available": false}, {"title": "事儿多", "file": "9750522.html", "available": false}, {"title": "夏小妞，很给力", "file": "9750523.html", "available": false}, {"title": "进局子了", "file": "9750524.html", "available": false}, {"title": "又遇故人", "file": "9750526.html", "available": false}, {"title": "原来如此", "file": "975